# Machine-generated bakeoff output. Serialisation is owned by the result
# generators in scripts/*.bench-suite.ts, not by Prettier: each generator is the
# single writer of its file, and a formatter rewriting that output would make
# every re-run dirty the tree for reasons unrelated to the experiment.
#
# This is NOT unchecked. Integrity is asserted separately — parsing, schema
# shape, corpus and artifact provenance, absence of raw geometry, and stale-row
# contamination — by scripts/results-integrity.test.ts, which DOES run in CI.
#
# Narrow by design: only the generated JSON in this one directory. Every other
# file under docs/, including the Markdown in this same directory, is
# hand-maintained and stays formatted.
docs/repair/bakeoff/*.json
docs/repair/repair-performance.json

